ter wall of the west wing (plan right) on floors 0, 2 and 3 and in the east wall on floors 0 and 1; cuts close them so the rooms along those walls (228, 238, 330) don't leak outside.","The library plan is a diagram: rooms are drawn as blocks with simplified walls; open areas (rotunda, stacks, reading room) are separated along the drawn wall lines and by their labels.","The two restroom icons next to room 70 point with arrows at the small rooms east of them; those rooms get the restroom kind."],"fit":{"transform":"similarity","points":8,"max_m":1.19,"rms_m":0.78,"loo_max_m":1.55,"m_per_px":0.1223,"rot_deg":-179.84,"outside_outline_max_m":0.8,"control":[{"what":"outer corner of the east wing's south end (plan top left; the plan is drawn south up)","px":[60.5,1124.7],"ll":[34.071225,-118.441817],"res_m":0.1},{"what":"inner corner of the east wing's south end","px":[179.3,1124.7],"ll":[34.071224,-118.441979],"res_m":0.31},{"what":"inner corner of the west wing's south end","px":[477.9,1124.7],"ll":[34.071225,-118.442367],"res_m":0.47},{"what":"outer corner of the west wing's south end (plan top right)","px":[593.2,1124.7],"ll":[34.071224,-118.442528],"res_m":0.31},{"what":"north-east corner of the building (plan bottom left)","px":[54.5,1723.4],"ll":[34.071897,-118.441814],"res_m":1.06},{"what":"north-west corner of the building (plan bottom right)","px":[607.5,1723.4],"ll":[34.071894,-118.442545],"res_m":0.92},{"what":"jog in the east wall where the wider north block starts","px":[54.5,1585.9],"ll":[34.071726,-118.441813],"res_m":1.03},{"what":"jog in the west wall where the wider north block starts","px":[607.5,1585.9],"ll":[34.071723,-118.442543],"res_m":1.19}],"px_to_m":[[-0.122338,-0.000352,301.21349],[-0.000352,0.122338,-2.176592],[0.0,0.0,1.0]]},"trace":{"mode":"vector","tool":"maps/trace_plan.py","date":"2026-10-15","plan_file":"Powell-floorplan-color_link_0.pdf","page":1,"dpi":150.0,"params":{"door_m":2.0,"min_room_m2":5.0,"split_on":"text"},"sealed_doors":38,"